{"unit_id":"4d51ee9df0be23752aa7","title":"提案四                                              提案人︰審查組","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b11","raw_text":"提案四                                              提案人︰審查組 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":58,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,273.0294189453125,571.6199951171875,287.07391357421875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b12","raw_text":"案由：增列糖尿病用藥GLP-1-insulin 複方針劑checklist。  \n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,297.2249755859375,442.260009765625,312.2249755859375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b13","raw_text":"說明： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,322.9539489746094,74.57363891601562,336.9939270019531]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b14","raw_text":"一、 糖尿病用藥含lixisenatide 及insulin glargine 之複方製劑(Soliqua)已於\n","start_char":0,"end_char":57,"bbox":[40.55472183227539,344.673828125,545.7826538085938,363.8384094238281]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b15","raw_text":"110/7/1 修正公告。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[76.56729125976562,372.99249267578125,206.1143798828125,387.032470703125]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b16","raw_text":"二、 限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量Metformin 及/或 Sulfonylurea 類藥物，且併用下\n","start_char":0,"end_char":52,"bbox":[40.5687255859375,394.6000671386719,569.8795166015625,413.7646484375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b17","raw_text":"列藥品之一持續六個月之後，HBA1c 仍高於8.0%以上之第二型糖尿病成人病人\n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[76.56729125976562,423.03106689453125,552.5906982421875,437.071044921875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b18","raw_text":"(110/7/1): \n","start_char":0,"end_char":12,"bbox":[76.55322265625,447.99420166015625,153.56118774414062,462.0341796875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b19","raw_text":"(1)SGLT-2 抑制劑 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":15,"bbox":[73.54866027832031,472.95733642578125,189.0557403564453,486.997314453125]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b20","raw_text":"(2)DPP-4 抑制劑 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[73.56269836425781,498.03277587890625,182.10594177246094,512.07275390625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b21","raw_text":"(3)SGLT-2 抑制劑合併 DPP-4 抑制劑複方藥品 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[73.56269836425781,522.9959106445312,360.6666564941406,537.035888671875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b22","raw_text":"       (4)Insulin(每日劑量小於60 單位) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[25.5599365234375,547.9590454101562,298.6239318847656,561.9990234375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b23","raw_text":"三、本藥品不得與DPP-4 抑制劑、SGLT-2 抑制劑併用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[39.59999084472656,573.0344848632812,386.2335510253906,587.074462890625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b24","raw_text":"辦法：增列糖尿病用藥GLP-1-insulin 複方針劑checklist 供會員參考，如附件五。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":51,"bbox":[25.57403564453125,597.9976196289062,550.768310546875,612.03759765625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b25","raw_text":"決議：照案通過。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":10,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,622.1849365234375,153.17999267578125,637.1849365234375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b26","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,648.033935546875,32.57999801635742,662.0739135742188]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b27","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,672.9970703125,576.9000244140625,705.2750244140625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-1f811bfbe41e4edee3c5-p3-b27","raw_text":"臨時提案一                               提案人：小兒科-陳信宏醫師 \n","start_char":2,"end_char":53,"bbox":[25.559999465942383,672.9970703125,576.9000244140625,705.2750244140625]}],"source_quality":[]}